===Etymology 2===
Shortened from {{m|vi|hành hạ}}.

Coinage most likely facilitated by the homophony of the unrelated noun above, leading to further coinage of phrases like {{m|vi|bán hành||to torment physically/to sell scallion}} and {{m|vi|bón hành||to give a one-sided beating/to spoon-feed scallion}}.

